# 行尾规范化
# 仓库内一律存 LF；检出到 Windows 时用 CRLF。
# 例外：.bat 必须是 CRLF —— cmd.exe 对 LF-only 的批处理会解析错乱。
* text=auto eol=crlf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psm1 text eol=crlf
*.xaml text eol=crlf

*.js  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.asar binary
*.node binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
